      "pronunciationText": "Last video ended with this question. Until now, we've known the mean and the standard deviation, and found a probability. This time the probability is fixed. The filling machine has a dial that sets the mean fill. Only one percent of bottles can be under four ninety, sigma stays at eight, and the mean is the unknown. Where must the dial be set?"
